   "issue": "`localRep_center` (line 78), `image_extChartAt_center` (line 87) and `dom_subset_baseSet` (line 96) are general `FiniteBundleAtlas` facts unrelated to distributions, but they are `private`. The remaining steps of PH6.1 (`MemSobolev` of the image, surjectivity) need the same link between the readings at `A.center i` and the chart data of `A`.",
